        <p class="text-text-secondary text-lg md:text-xl max-w-2xl mx-auto leading-relaxed">
          No hidden fees. No surprise bills. Cancel anytime.
          <br />
          <span class="text-accent font-semibold">Pro plan now live</span> — start in 2 minutes.
        </p>
