        </p>

        <!-- Summary Cards -->
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-4">
          <div class="bg-dark-secondary rounded-xl border border-accent/20 p-5">
            <span class="text-2xl mb-2 block">⚡</span>
            <span class="text-accent font-bold text-lg">2-Minute Setup</span>
            <p class="text-text-muted text-sm mt-1">Click, connect, done. No downloads, no coding, no waiting.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-dark-secondary rounded-xl border border-terminal-blue/20 p-5">
            <span class="text-2xl mb-2 block">🔌</span>
            <span class="text-terminal-blue font-bold text-lg">15+ Channels</span>
            <p class="text-text-muted text-sm mt-1">Telegram, WhatsApp, Slack, Discord, Email — all connected.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="bg-dark-secondary rounded-xl border border-terminal-magenta/20 p-5">
            <span class="text-2xl mb-2 block">🧠</span>
            <span class="text-terminal-magenta font-bold text-lg">Claude 4.5 Built-in</span>
            <p class="text-text-muted text-sm mt-1">Top-tier AI included. No separate subscription needed.</p>
