            <button class="faq-toggle w-full text-left px-6 py-4 flex items-center justify-between text-white font-medium hover:bg-dark-tertiary/50 transition-colors">
              <span>What AI model is included?</span>
              <span class="faq-icon text-accent font-mono text-sm">+</span>
            </button>
            <div class="faq-content hidden px-6 pb-4 text-text-muted text-sm leading-relaxed">
              Pro plan includes Claude 4.5 by Anthropic — one of the most capable AI models available. Approximately $20/month worth of AI usage is bundled in your subscription. No separate API key needed.
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="faq-item border border-dark-tertiary rounded-lg overflow-hidden">
            <button class="faq-toggle w-full text-left px-6 py-4 flex items-center justify-between text-white font-medium hover:bg-dark-tertiary/50 transition-colors">
              <span>Can I cancel anytime?</span>
              <span class="faq-icon text-accent font-mono text-sm">+</span>
            </button>
